# The transitive normal-dependency closure of the production build command of
# the two lock binaries (design §4.14, T-D1), the output of
#   cargo tree -e normal --prefix none -p celestina-lock -p celestina-lock-verify
# reduced to crate names. A crate that arrives through a feature or a
# transitive edge fails tests/closure.rs and stops the executor. Task 5 (the
# CPU painter) and the tokens add their crates to this list in the same edit
# that adds the dependency.
#
# The two packages and the vocabulary they share.
celestina-lock
celestina-lock-verify
celestina-lock-proto
# The Wayland toolkit without the `gl` feature, and what the session-lock
# protocol needs (smithay-client-toolkit, wayland-client and its protocol
# crates, calloop as the loop, xkbcommon for the keymap).
celestina-wayland
smithay-client-toolkit
calloop
calloop-wayland-source
polling
wayland-client
wayland-backend
wayland-sys
wayland-scanner
wayland-protocols
wayland-protocols-experimental
wayland-protocols-misc
wayland-protocols-wlr
wayland-csd-frame
wayland-cursor
xkbcommon
xkeysym
cursor-icon
xcursor
memmap2
bytemuck
bytemuck_derive
downcast-rs
quick-xml
lazy_static
log
# System interface: rustix is the safe syscall API of both binaries; libc and
# nix (user lookup) are the verifier's.
rustix
linux-raw-sys
bitflags
cfg-if
libc
nix
memchr
once_cell
pin-project-lite
# Logging facade and the fixed-level subscriber (no env-filter, so no regex).
tracing
tracing-attributes
tracing-core
tracing-subscriber
sharded-slab
thread_local
smallvec
# Typed errors, zeroing of secret buffers, proc-macro support.
thiserror
thiserror-impl
zeroize
proc-macro2
quote
syn
unicode-ident
# The CPU painter (design §4.6.1, H-15): tiny-skia for shapes; cosmic-text for
# shaping (harfrust, skrifa, read-fonts, font-types, unicode-*) and glyph
# rasterisation (swash, zeno, yazi); fontdb (empty database, no fontconfig,
# no PNG decoder) and its parser ttf-parser; the style tokens. Added with the
# painter, in the same edit as the dependencies.
celestina-tokens
tiny-skia
tiny-skia-path
arrayref
arrayvec
strict-num
cosmic-text
fontdb
ttf-parser
tinyvec
slotmap
harfrust
skrifa
read-fonts
font-types
core_maths
libm
linebender_resource_handle
rangemap
rustc-hash
self_cell
smol_str
swash
zeno
yazi
sys-locale
unicode-bidi
unicode-linebreak
unicode-script
unicode-segmentation
